{# Variables: matrix (MethodologyMatrix dict), limitations (list[LimitationsExtraction dicts]) #}
Identify research gaps by diffing cross-paper methodology matrix vs per-paper limitations.

METHODOLOGY MATRIX:
{{ matrix | tojson(indent=2) }}

PER-PAPER LIMITATIONS (citations are [P<paper_id>-N] from each paper):
{% for lim in limitations %}
- paper_id: {{ lim.paper_id }}
  limitations: {{ lim.limitations | tojson }}
  future_work: {{ lim.future_work | tojson }}
{% endfor %}

OUTPUT: STRICT JSON matching GapAnalysis:
  - gaps: [{text, citations: ["[P<paper_id>-N]", ...]}, ...]
Each gap MUST cite >= 1 passage (any paper). Gaps should identify what the matrix
doesn't cover, or cross-paper shortcomings surfaced by the limitations.
